QUARANTINED. Pre-transactional fit artifacts, no fit_manifest.json.

These predate the run-dir + completion-manifest design (R-209(3)). A
manifest-less directory on the PROMOTED path is exactly what stage_score's
manifest requirement exists to refuse -- but leaving them there invites a
future reader to treat them as a completed fit.

Renamed, not deleted: they are the artifacts of the pre-transactional era and
are referenced by earlier register rows.
